# Alpixn HR & Payroll Software — Backend

This is the backend service for **Alpixn Technologies’ AI-powered HR and Payroll Software**, built to streamline human resource management, automate payroll operations, and enable intelligent decision-making with AI modules.

---

## Project Goals

### Core Functionalities
- Employee data management
- Attendance tracking with geo-fencing & face recognition
- Leave and expense management
- Payroll processing with dynamic forecasting
- Payslip generation & blockchain verification
- Performance reviews & 360° feedback system

### AI-Powered Features
- Mood Index (Emotional wellbeing via sentiment analysis)
- Retention Risk Prediction (attrition risk scoring)
- Career Path Recommendations (upskilling & promotion planning)
- Salary Benchmarking & Tax Optimization Assistant

### Access Control
- Role-Based Access: Admin > HR > Manager > Employee
- Login audit logging and notification system

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| Backend Framework | FastAPI (Python) |
| ORM & DB | SQLAlchemy + PostgreSQL |
| Data Validation | Pydantic |
| Migrations | Alembic |
| AI Models | Python (scikit-learn, TensorFlow, OpenAI API) |
| Authentication | OAuth2 + JWT |
| DevOps | Docker + GitHub Actions (planned) |

---

